{"s":84,"v":[{"t":"When the sky has split [open]","w":[["إِذَا","When","idhā",""],["ٱلسَّمَآءُ","the sky","l-samāu","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَآءُ",49]]],["ٱنشَقَّتْ","is split asunder","inshaqqat",""]]},{"t":"And has listened [i.e., responded] to its Lord and was obligated [to do so]","w":[["وَأَذِنَتْ","And has listened","wa-adhinat","",[["وَ",1],["أَذِنَتْ",452]]],["لِرَبِّهَا","to its Lord","lirabbihā","",[["لِ",8],["رَبِّ",24],["هَا",22]]],["وَحُقَّتْ","and was obligated","waḥuqqat","",[["وَ",1],["حُقَّتْ",505]]]]},{"t":"And when the earth has been extended","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["ٱلْأَرْضُ","the earth","l-arḍu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضُ",35]]],["مُدَّتْ","is spread","muddat",""]]},{"t":"And has cast out that within it and relinquished [it].","w":[["وَأَلْقَتْ","And has cast out","wa-alqat","",[["وَ",1],["أَلْقَتْ",180]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["فِيهَا","(is) in it","fīhā","",[["فِي",14],["هَا",22]]],["وَتَخَلَّتْ","and becomes empty","watakhallat","",[["وَ",1],["تَخَلَّتْ",3147]]]]},{"t":"And has listened [i.e., responded] to its Lord and was obligated [to do so] -","w":[["وَأَذِنَتْ","And has listened","wa-adhinat","",[["وَ",1],["أَذِنَتْ",452]]],["لِرَبِّهَا","to its Lord","lirabbihā","",[["لِ",8],["رَبِّ",24],["هَا",22]]],["وَحُقَّتْ","and was obligated","waḥuqqat","",[["وَ",1],["حُقَّتْ",505]]]]},{"t":"O mankind, indeed you are laboring toward your Lord with [great] exertion and will meet it.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","mankind","l-insānu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسَـٰنُ",181]]],["إِنَّكَ","Indeed, you","innaka","",[["إِنَّ",15],["كَ",18]]],["كَادِحٌ","(are) laboring","kādiḥun",""],["إِلَىٰ","to","ilā",""],["رَبِّكَ","your Lord","rabbika","",[["رَبِّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["كَدْحًۭا","(with) exertion","kadḥan",""],["فَمُلَـٰقِيهِ","and you (will) meet Him","famulāqīhi","",[["فَ",7],["مُلَـٰقِي",2693],["هِ",5]]]]},{"t":"Then as for he who is given his record in his right hand,","w":[["فَأَمَّا","Then as for","fa-ammā","",[["فَ",7],["أَمَّا",224]]],["مَنْ","(him) who","man",""],["أُوتِىَ","is given","ūtiya",""],["كِتَـٰبَهُۥ","his record","kitābahu","",[["كِتَـٰبَ",63],["هُۥ",5]]],["بِيَمِينِهِۦ","in his right (hand)","biyamīnihi","",[["بِ",10],["يَمِينِ",193],["هِۦ",5]]]]},{"t":"He will be judged with an easy account","w":[["فَسَوْفَ","Then soon","fasawfa","",[["فَ",7],["سَوْفَ",290]]],["يُحَاسَبُ","his account will be taken","yuḥāsabu",""],["حِسَابًۭا","an account","ḥisāban",""],["يَسِيرًۭا","easy","yasīran",""]]},{"t":"And return to his people in happiness.","w":[["وَيَنقَلِبُ","And he will return","wayanqalibu","",[["وَ",1],["يَنقَلِبُ",563]]],["إِلَىٰٓ","to","ilā",""],["أَهْلِهِۦ","his people","ahlihi","",[["أَهْلِ",112],["هِۦ",5]]],["مَسْرُورًۭا","happily","masrūran",""]]},{"t":"But as for he who is given his record behind his back,","w":[["وَأَمَّا","But as for","wa-ammā","",[["وَ",1],["أَمَّا",224]]],["مَنْ","(him) who","man",""],["أُوتِىَ","is given","ūtiya",""],["كِتَـٰبَهُۥ","his record","kitābahu","",[["كِتَـٰبَ",63],["هُۥ",5]]],["وَرَآءَ","behind","warāa",""],["ظَهْرِهِۦ","his back","ẓahrihi","",[["ظَهْرِ",626],["هِۦ",5]]]]},{"t":"He will cry out for destruction","w":[["فَسَوْفَ","Then soon","fasawfa","",[["فَ",7],["سَوْفَ",290]]],["يَدْعُوا۟","he will call","yadʿū",""],["ثُبُورًۭا","(for) destruction","thubūran",""]]},{"t":"And [enter to] burn in a Blaze.","w":[["وَيَصْلَىٰ","And he will burn","wayaṣlā","",[["وَ",1],["يَصْلَىٰ",699]]],["سَعِيرًا","(in) a Blaze","saʿīran",""]]},{"t":"Indeed, he had [once] been among his people in happiness;","w":[["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed, he","innahu","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هُۥ",5]]],["كَانَ","had been","kāna",""],["فِىٓ","among","fī",""],["أَهْلِهِۦ","his people","ahlihi","",[["أَهْلِ",112],["هِۦ",5]]],["مَسْرُورًا","happy","masrūran",""]]},{"t":"Indeed, he had thought he would never return [to Allāh].","w":[["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed, he","innahu","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هُۥ",5]]],["ظَنَّ","(had) thought","ẓanna",""],["أَن","that","an",""],["لَّن","never","lan",""],["يَحُورَ","he would return","yaḥūra",""]]},{"t":"But yes! Indeed, his Lord was ever, of him, Seeing.","w":[["بَلَىٰٓ","Yes","balā",""],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["رَبَّهُۥ","his Lord","rabbahu","",[["رَبَّ",24],["هُۥ",5]]],["كَانَ","was","kāna",""],["بِهِۦ","of him","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["بَصِيرًۭا","All-Seer","baṣīran",""]]},{"t":"So I swear by the twilight glow","w":[["فَلَآ","But nay","falā","",[["فَ",7],["لَآ",13]]],["أُقْسِمُ","I swear","uq'simu",""],["بِٱلشَّفَقِ","by the twilight glow","bil-shafaqi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱل",2],["شَّفَقِ",3707]]]]},{"t":"And [by] the night and what it envelops","w":[["وَٱلَّيْلِ","And the night","wa-al-layli","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلِ",150]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["وَسَقَ","it envelops","wasaqa",""]]},{"t":"And [by] the moon when it becomes full","w":[["وَٱلْقَمَرِ","And the moon","wal-qamari","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["قَمَرِ",410]]],["إِذَا","when","idhā",""],["ٱتَّسَقَ","it becomes full","ittasaqa",""]]},{"t":"[That] you will surely embark upon [i.e., experience] state after state.","w":[["لَتَرْكَبُنَّ","You will surely embark","latarkabunna","",[["لَ",23],["تَرْكَبُ",895],["نَّ",0]]],["طَبَقًا","(to) stage","ṭabaqan",""],["عَن","from","ʿan",""],["طَبَقٍۢ","stage","ṭabaqin",""]]},{"t":"So what is [the matter] with them [that] they do not believe,","w":[["فَمَا","So what","famā","",[["فَ",7],["مَا",12]]],["لَهُمْ","(is) for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["لَا","not","lā",""],["يُؤْمِنُونَ","they believe","yu'minūna","",[["يُؤْمِنُ",30],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And when the Qur’ān is recited to them, they do not prostrate [to Allāh]?","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["قُرِئَ","is recited","quri-a",""],["عَلَيْهِمُ","to them","ʿalayhimu","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمُ",3]]],["ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","the Quran","l-qur'ānu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قُرْءَانُ",186]]],["لَا","not","lā",""],["يَسْجُدُونَ","they prostrate","yasjudūna","۩",[["يَسْجُدُ",343],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"But those who have disbelieved deny,","w":[["بَلِ","Nay","bali",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieved","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["يُكَذِّبُونَ","deny","yukadhibūna","",[["يُكَذِّبُ",80],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And Allāh is most knowing of what they keep within themselves.","w":[["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["أَعْلَمُ","(is) most knowing","aʿlamu",""],["بِمَا","of what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["يُوعُونَ","they keep within themselves","yūʿūna","",[["يُوعُ",2164],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"So give them tidings of a painful punishment,","w":[["فَبَشِّرْهُم","so give them tidings","fabashir'hum","",[["فَ",7],["بَشِّرْ",318],["هُم",3]]],["بِعَذَابٍ","of a punishment","biʿadhābin","",[["بِ",10],["عَذَابٍ",48]]],["أَلِيمٍ","painful","alīmin",""]]},{"t":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds. For them is a reward uninterrupted.","w":[["إِلَّا","Except","illā",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["وَعَمِلُوا۟","and do","waʿamilū","",[["وَ",1],["عَمِلُ",58],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","righteous deeds","l-ṣāliḥāti","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ",102]]],["لَهُمْ","For them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["أَجْرٌ","(is) a reward","ajrun",""],["غَيْرُ","never","ghayru",""],["مَمْنُونٍۭ","ending","mamnūnin",""]]}]}